  # turnaround: double kicks and a hit to throw it back to the top
  C-2 1 40 S80 | A-2 2 36     | .        | A-4 4 30 | A-3 5 36 | .
  .            | .            | .        | .        | .        | .
  C-2 1 40     | .            | C-6 3 22 | .        | .        | .
